"Riley Lin is a C-rank Stamina Brute who lived on Anesidora her whole life."
"She has soft curls, a barrette and magenta nail polish."
"She ran away with Superhumans at Large and designs their stickers, like SAL for True Peace."
"She believes Avowed are Earth's protectors and should cross every border."
"As a child she dreamed of being the hero Lightning Riley."
